# 2. Inference Hyperparameters (low temperature for deterministic grounded outputs)
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
PARAMETER stop "User:"
PARAMETER stop "Official:"

# 3. System Prompt & Strict Anti-Hallucination Guardrails
